# PROJECT RULES - DO NOT IGNORE

- NEVER create or modify 'vite.config.js'.
- ALWAYS use 'vite.config.ts' for configuration.
- If 'vite.config.js' exists, DELETE it immediately without asking.
- This is a TypeScript project; avoid creating '.js' files when '.ts' equivalents are present.
- When modifying PWA settings, only edit 'vite.config.ts'.